scenario.en:
import { vi, test, expect } from 'vitest';

test('debounce', () => {
  vi.useFakeTimers();
  const fn = vi.fn();
  const d = debounce(fn, 200); // calls fn 200ms after the LAST invocation
  d(); d(); d();              // three rapid calls
  vi.advanceTimersByTime(199);
  // (A) how many times has fn been called here?
  vi.advanceTimersByTime(1);
  // (B) and here?
});

What does the spy report at point (A) and point (B), and why?

